# Renaming the INBOX project to Inbox moves it under Projects, and gi then says there is no inbox.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call mom
END
keys <Enter> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS>
type nbox
keys <Esc> gi
status No INBOX project in the Navigator
keys <C-g>
see Projects
see   Inbox                                     1 │
quit
saved <<END
Inbox:
	- Call mom
END
